      "content": {
        "text": "You can now untangle special profit rules by separating them into layers.\n\nFirst remove the manager's cut, charity, equal portion or other special amount. Then divide only the remainder by capital or capital-time.\n\nA working partner usually receives both the special amount and the ordinary share.\n\nNext, we use the same partnership logic outside a business — to split rent and shared costs fairly.",
