    "sourceScope": "R.S. Aggarwal, Quantitative Aptitude for Competitive Examinations, Chapter 14, Partnership. Approved scope: Teach working-partner questions as a two-layer distribution: first remove any manager's commission, charity, equal portion or other stated special allocation; then divide only the remaining profit by the relevant capital or capital-time ratio. Cover a working partner who also receives an ordinary capital share, charity before distribution, part of profit split equally and the rest by capital, and interest-on-capital style splits from the objective exercise. Make the order of operations explicit so the special amount is never accidentally divided again."
